{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "00000000-auth-keycloak-emprendia-0001",
    "name": "00 – Auth Keycloak",
    "description": "Autenticación y administración de usuarios contra Keycloak.\n\n**FLUJO RECOMENDADO PARA CREAR USUARIO:**\n1. Login – Obtener JWT (opcional, para probar)\n2. Get Admin Token – Obtener token de admin para la Admin REST API\n3. Create User en Keycloak – Crea el usuario en Keycloak y guarda su ID en {{keycloak_user_id}}\n4. Ir a colección 02-User-Service > POST Crear usuario para crear el perfil local\n\n**Prerrequisito Keycloak:**\n- Realm: emprendia\n- Client: emprendia-app\n- Client → Settings → Direct Access Grants: ON\n- Client → Authentication → Client authentication: OFF (public client)\n- Cliente 'admin-cli' en realm 'master' (viene por defecto)\n- Credenciales de admin configuradas en el environment ({{keycloak_admin_username}} / {{keycloak_admin_password}})",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login – Obtener JWT",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Login exitoso (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Contiene access_token', () => pm.expect(r.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
              "",
              "if (r.access_token) {",
              "    pm.environment.set('access_token', r.access_token);",
              "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token);",
              "",
              "    // Guardar timestamp de expiración",
              "    const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + r.expires_in * 1000).toISOString();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_expires_at', expiresAt);",
              "",
              "    console.log('✅ Token guardado. Expira en:', r.expires_in, 'segundos (' + expiresAt + ')');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.error('❌ No se recibió access_token. Verifica credenciales y configuración del cliente Keycloak.');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password",
              "description": "Resource Owner Password Credentials flow",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "{{keycloak_client_id}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "{{keycloak_username}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "{{keycloak_password}}",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{keycloak_realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["realms", "{{keycloak_realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Solicita un JWT con usuario y contraseña. El test script guarda el access_token y refresh_token en las variables de entorno automáticamente."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Refresh Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Refresh exitoso (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "",
              "if (r.access_token) {",
              "    pm.environment.set('access_token', r.access_token);",
              "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token);",
              "    const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + r.expires_in * 1000).toISOString();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_expires_at', expiresAt);",
              "    console.log('✅ Token renovado. Nuevo expiry:', expiresAt);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{keycloak_client_id}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{refresh_token}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{keycloak_realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["realms", "{{keycloak_realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Renueva el access_token usando el refresh_token guardado. Útil cuando el token expira (por defecto 5 min en Keycloak)."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Logout (Revocar Token)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Logout exitoso (204)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
              "pm.environment.unset('access_token');",
              "pm.environment.unset('refresh_token');",
              "pm.environment.unset('token_expires_at');",
              "console.log('✅ Tokens revocados y eliminados del entorno.');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{keycloak_client_id}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{refresh_token}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{keycloak_realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/logout",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["realms", "{{keycloak_realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "logout"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Admin Token (Master Realm)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Admin login exitoso (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "",
              "if (r.access_token) {",
              "    pm.environment.set('admin_token', r.access_token);",
              "    console.log('🔑 Token de admin guardado en {{admin_token}}');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.error('❌ No se obtuvo admin_token. Verifica credenciales de admin en el environment.');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "client_id", "value": "admin-cli", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "username", "value": "{{keycloak_admin_username}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "password", "value": "{{keycloak_admin_password}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["realms", "master", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene un token de administrador usando el cliente 'admin-cli' del realm 'master'. Las credenciales se configuran en las variables {{keycloak_admin_username}} y {{keycloak_admin_password}}. Este token permite usar la Admin REST API de Keycloak."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create User en Keycloak + Asignar rol",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code !== 201) {",
              "    console.error('❌ No se pudo crear el usuario en Keycloak');",
              "    return;",
              "}",
              "",
              "const location = pm.response.headers.get('Location');",
              "if (!location) {",
              "    console.error('❌ No se encontró header Location en la respuesta');",
              "    return;",
              "}",
              "",
              "const userId = location.split('/').pop();",
              "pm.environment.set('keycloak_user_id', userId);",
              "console.log('✅ Usuario creado en Keycloak con ID:', userId);",
              "",
              "// --- Asignar rol al usuario ---",
              "const adminToken = pm.environment.get('admin_token');",
              "const keycloakUrl = pm.environment.get('keycloak_url');",
              "const realm = pm.environment.get('keycloak_realm');",
              "const roleName = pm.environment.get('keycloak_role_name') || 'comun-user';",
              "",
              "// 1. Obtener el ID del rol por su nombre",
              "pm.sendRequest({",
              "    url: `${keycloakUrl}/admin/realms/${realm}/roles/${roleName}`,",
              "    method: 'GET',",
              "    header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + adminToken }",
              "}, (err, roleRes) => {",
              "    if (err || roleRes.code !== 200) {",
              "        console.warn('⚠️  El rol \"' + roleName + '\" no existe en Keycloak. Créalo manualmente o verifica el nombre.');",
              "        console.log('➡️  Luego asigna el rol manualmente desde: ' + keycloakUrl + '/admin/master/console/#/realms/' + realm + '/users/' + userId + '/role-mappings');",
              "        return;",
              "    }",
              "",
              "    const role = roleRes.json();",
              "    console.log('🔍 Rol encontrado:', role.name, '(' + role.id + ')');",
              "",
              "    // 2. Asignar el rol al usuario",
              "    pm.sendRequest({",
              "        url: `${keycloakUrl}/admin/realms/${realm}/users/${userId}/role-mappings/realm`,",
              "        method: 'POST',",
              "        header: {",
              "            'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + adminToken,",
              "            'Content-Type': 'application/json'",
              "        },",
              "        body: {",
              "            mode: 'raw',",
              "            raw: JSON.stringify([{",
              "                id: role.id,",
              "                name: role.name",
              "            }])",
              "        }",
              "    }, (err2, assignRes) => {",
              "        if (err2 || assignRes.code !== 204) {",
              "            console.warn('⚠️  No se pudo asignar el rol \"' + roleName + '\". Código:', assignRes?.code);",
              "            return;",
              "        }",
              "        console.log('✅ Rol \"' + roleName + '\" asignado al usuario ' + userId);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "",
              "console.log('➡️  Ahora usa \"POST Crear usuario\" en la colección 02-User-Service para crear el perfil local.');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            { "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nuevo_usuario\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@email.com\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Kevin\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Guachagmira\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"emailVerified\": true,\n  \"credentials\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"password\",\n      \"value\": \"Temporal123!\",\n      \"temporary\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/admin/realms/{{keycloak_realm}}/users",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["admin", "realms", "{{keycloak_realm}}", "users"]
        },
        "description": "Crea un usuario en Keycloak y le asigna el rol definido en {{keycloak_role_name}} (default: 'comun-user').\n\nRequiere haber ejecutado primero 'Get Admin Token'.\n\nEl role debe existir previamente en Keycloak (crearlo desde la consola admin si es necesario)."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Introspect Token (Validar JWT)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Respuesta 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Token activo', () => pm.expect(r.active).to.be.true);",
              "if (r.active) {",
              "    console.log('✅ Token válido');",
              "    console.log('  Usuario:', r.preferred_username);",
              "    console.log('  Email:', r.email);",
              "    console.log('  Roles:', JSON.stringify(r.realm_access?.roles));",
              "    console.log('  Expira:', new Date(r.exp * 1000).toISOString());",
              "} else {",
              "    console.warn('⚠️ Token inactivo o expirado');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{keycloak_client_id}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{keycloak_realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token/introspect",
          "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
          "path": ["realms", "{{keycloak_realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token", "introspect"]
        },
        "description": "Muestra el contenido decodificado del JWT: username, email, roles, expiración. Útil para depurar claims."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
